{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4aDQeivLBFVQHptTcW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient door stands before you, its surface weathered oak bound with iron bands gone rust-red with centuries. A keyhole glints dully at its center — a single eye waiting.*\n\nYou present the key.\n\n*A tremor runs through the wood. The iron bands groan. The keyhole accepts — teeth catching tumblers, each one falling with a sound like a whispered syllable of a forgotten name.*\n\n**CHUNK.**\n\n*The door exhales. A breath of air from the other side — cool, carrying the scent of rain on stone, of somewhere that has been sealed and waiting.*\n\n*I swing inward on hinges that sing one low, resonant note.*\n\n*Beyond: a corridor lit by no visible source, the light the color of late afternoon. The walls breathe slowly. The floor is polished to a mirror. At the far end, something is moving — or perhaps just arrived, having waited as long as I have.*\n\n*You may pass.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":215,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}